<title>GREECE: Athens bourse clears European Reliance IPO.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse clears European Reliance IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of insurance firm European Reliance for listing on its main market, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>European Reliance AEGA will issue 876,620 new common registered shares and 106,930 registered preferred non-voting shares with a par value of 165 drachmas.</p>
<p>Proceeds will finance new branches in several Greek cities and the launch of new products. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
